{"seq":4,"slug":"migration-guide","title":"迁移指南：从 ESLint/Prettier 到新一代工具","url":"/l-doc-books/h/editors-compilers/code-formatting-linting/next-gen-tools/migration-guide","wordCount":818,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"迁移指南-从-eslint-prettier-到新一代工具\">迁移指南：从 ESLint/Prettier 到新一代工具</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>从 ESLint + Prettier 迁移到 Biome 或 oxlint 不是一个简单的工具替换，而是一个<strong>渐进式的工具链重构过程</strong>。成功的迁移需要评估现有配置的复杂度、识别不可迁移的规则、制定分阶段的切换计划，并在整个过程中保证代码质量不降级。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[评估现有工具链] --&gt; B[识别规则覆盖缺口]&#10;    B --&gt; C[制定迁移策略]&#10;    C --&gt; D{策略选择}&#10;    D --&gt; E[全量迁移到 Biome]&#10;    D --&gt; F[渐进式引入 oxlint]&#10;    D --&gt; G[混合方案]&#10;    E --&gt; H[验证与回归测试]&#10;    F --&gt; H&#10;    G --&gt; H&#10;    H --&gt; I[团队培训与切换]\">flowchart TD\n    A[评估现有工具链] --&gt; B[识别规则覆盖缺口]\n    B --&gt; C[制定迁移策略]\n    C --&gt; D{策略选择}\n    D --&gt; E[全量迁移到 Biome]\n    D --&gt; F[渐进式引入 oxlint]\n    D --&gt; G[混合方案]\n    E --&gt; H[验证与回归测试]\n    F --&gt; H\n    G --&gt; H\n    H --&gt; I[团队培训与切换]</pre><p>三种迁移策略的对比：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>策略</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n<th>风险</th>\n<th>工期</th>\n<th>最终状态</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>全量迁移 Biome</td>\n<td>小中型项目，规则简单</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>1-3 天</td>\n<td>Biome 单一工具</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>渐进引入 oxlint</td>\n<td>大型项目，复杂 ESLint 配置</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>1-4 周</td>\n<td>oxlint + ESLint</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>混合方案</td>\n<td>自定义规则多，性能需求高</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>2-4 周</td>\n<td>Biome/oxlint + ESLint</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"迁移前评估\">迁移前评估</h2><p>迁移的第一步是对现有工具链进行全面审计，明确哪些规则可以迁移、哪些需要保留。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"npx eslint --print-config src/index.ts &gt; eslint-effective-config.json&#10;&#10;npx @biomejs/biome migrate eslint --write&#10;npx @biomejs/biome migrate prettier --write\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">npx</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> eslint</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --print-config</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> src/index.ts</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ></span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> eslint-effective-config.json</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">npx</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> @biomejs/biome</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> migrate</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> eslint</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --write</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">npx</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> @biomejs/biome</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> migrate</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> prettier</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --write</span></span></code></pre></div><p>评估清单：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface MigrationAudit {&#10;  eslintRules: {&#10;    total: number;&#10;    coveredByBiome: number;&#10;    coveredByOxlint: number;&#10;    requireTypeInfo: number;&#10;    customRules: number;&#10;    uncoverable: number;&#10;  };&#10;  prettierConfig: {&#10;    standardOptions: number;&#10;    customPlugins: string[];&#10;    overrides: number;&#10;  };&#10;  ciIntegration: {&#10;    lintStaged: boolean;&#10;    ciPipeline: boolean;&#10;    preCommitHooks: boolean;&#10;  };&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> MigrationAudit</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  eslintRules</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    total</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    coveredByBiome</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    coveredByOxlint</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    requireTypeInfo</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    customRules</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    uncoverable</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  prettierConfig</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    standardOptions</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    customPlugins</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    overrides</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  ciIntegration</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    lintStaged</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> boolean</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    ciPipeline</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> boolean</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    preCommitHooks</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> boolean</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>关键评估维度：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>评估项</th>\n<th>可迁移条件</th>\n<th>阻塞因素</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>ESLint 核心规则</td>\n<td>Biome/oxlint 已实现</td>\n<td>极少数规则未移植</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>TypeScript ESLint</td>\n<td>基础规则可迁移</td>\n<td>类型感知规则（Biome 不支持）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>React/Hooks 规则</td>\n<td>核心规则已移植</td>\n<td>部分边缘规则未覆盖</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>自定义规则</td>\n<td>无法迁移</td>\n<td>必须保留 ESLint</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Prettier 格式化</td>\n<td>Biome 97% 兼容</td>\n<td>特定插件（tailwindcss 排序）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Import 排序</td>\n<td>Biome 内置</td>\n<td>自定义排序规则</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"迁移到-biome\">迁移到 Biome</h2><p>Biome 提供了自动化的迁移命令，可以从现有的 Prettier 和 ESLint 配置生成 <code>biome.json</code>。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"npx @biomejs/biome init&#10;&#10;npx @biomejs/biome migrate prettier --write&#10;&#10;npx @biomejs/biome migrate eslint --write\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">npx</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> @biomejs/biome</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> init</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">npx</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> @biomejs/biome</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> migrate</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> prettier</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --write</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">npx</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> @biomejs/biome</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> migrate</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> eslint</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --write</span></span></code></pre></div><p>迁移后需要手动调整的部分：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;linter&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;rules&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;recommended&quot;: true,&#10;      &quot;correctness&quot;: {&#10;        &quot;noUnusedVariables&quot;: &quot;error&quot;,&#10;        &quot;noUnusedImports&quot;: &quot;error&quot;&#10;      },&#10;      &quot;suspicious&quot;: {&#10;        &quot;noExplicitAny&quot;: &quot;warn&quot;&#10;      }&#10;    }&#10;  },&#10;  &quot;formatter&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;indentStyle&quot;: &quot;space&quot;,&#10;    &quot;indentWidth&quot;: 2,&#10;    &quot;lineWidth&quot;: 80&#10;  },&#10;  &quot;javascript&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;formatter&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;quoteStyle&quot;: &quot;double&quot;,&#10;      &quot;semicolons&quot;: &quot;always&quot;,&#10;      &quot;trailingCommas&quot;: &quot;all&quot;&#10;    }&#10;  },&#10;  &quot;files&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;ignore&quot;: [&quot;dist/**&quot;, &quot;node_modules/**&quot;, &quot;coverage/**&quot;]&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"linter\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"rules\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"recommended\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"correctness\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"noUnusedVariables\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"error\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"noUnusedImports\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"error\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"suspicious\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"noExplicitAny\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"warn\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"formatter\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"indentStyle\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"space\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"indentWidth\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"lineWidth\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">80</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"javascript\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"formatter\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"quoteStyle\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"double\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"semicolons\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"always\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"trailingCommas\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"all\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"files\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"ignore\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"dist/**\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"node_modules/**\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"coverage/**\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>全量迁移的步骤清单：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const biomeMigrationSteps = [&#10;  &#39;1. 运行 biome init 生成基础配置&#39;,&#10;  &#39;2. 运行 biome migrate prettier --write 迁移格式化配置&#39;,&#10;  &#39;3. 运行 biome migrate eslint --write 迁移 lint 规则&#39;,&#10;  &#39;4. 运行 biome check . 检查现有代码&#39;,&#10;  &#39;5. 运行 biome check --write . 自动修复可修复的问题&#39;,&#10;  &#39;6. 手动处理 biome 报告的未覆盖规则&#39;,&#10;  &#39;7. 更新 package.json scripts&#39;,&#10;  &#39;8. 更新 CI 配置&#39;,&#10;  &#39;9. 更新编辑器设置（VS Code）&#39;,&#10;  &#39;10. 移除旧的 ESLint/Prettier 配置和依赖&#39;,&#10;];\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> biomeMigrationSteps</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  '1. 运行 biome init 生成基础配置'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  '2. 运行 biome migrate prettier --write 迁移格式化配置'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  '3. 运行 biome migrate eslint --write 迁移 lint 规则'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  '4. 运行 biome check . 检查现有代码'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  '5. 运行 biome check --write . 自动修复可修复的问题'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  '6. 手动处理 biome 报告的未覆盖规则'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  '7. 更新 package.json scripts'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  '8. 更新 CI 配置'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  '9. 更新编辑器设置（VS Code）'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  '10. 移除旧的 ESLint/Prettier 配置和依赖'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">];</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[biome init] --&gt; B[biome migrate prettier]&#10;    B --&gt; C[biome migrate eslint]&#10;    C --&gt; D[&quot;biome check . (审计)&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; E{有未覆盖规则?}&#10;    E --&gt;|是| F[保留 ESLint 处理]&#10;    E --&gt;|否| G[移除 ESLint/Prettier]&#10;    F --&gt; H[配置 lint-staged 双工具]&#10;    G --&gt; I[更新 package.json scripts]&#10;    H --&gt; J[更新 CI]&#10;    I --&gt; J&#10;    J --&gt; K[更新编辑器设置]\">flowchart TD\n    A[biome init] --&gt; B[biome migrate prettier]\n    B --&gt; C[biome migrate eslint]\n    C --&gt; D[\"biome check . (审计)\"]\n    D --&gt; E{有未覆盖规则?}\n    E --&gt;|是| F[保留 ESLint 处理]\n    E --&gt;|否| G[移除 ESLint/Prettier]\n    F --&gt; H[配置 lint-staged 双工具]\n    G --&gt; I[更新 package.json scripts]\n    H --&gt; J[更新 CI]\n    I --&gt; J\n    J --&gt; K[更新编辑器设置]</pre><h2 id=\"渐进引入-oxlint\">渐进引入 oxlint</h2><p>对于配置复杂的大型项目，推荐先引入 oxlint 作为 ESLint 的加速层，然后逐步扩大 oxlint 的规则覆盖。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"npm install -D oxlint eslint-plugin-oxlint\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">npm</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> install</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -D</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> oxlint</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> eslint-plugin-oxlint</span></span></code></pre></div><p>第一阶段：oxlint 处理基础规则，ESLint 自动跳过：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"import oxlint from &#39;eslint-plugin-oxlint&#39;;&#10;&#10;export default [...tseslint.configs.recommendedTypeChecked, ...oxlint.configs[&#39;flat/recommended&#39;]];\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> oxlint </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'eslint-plugin-oxlint'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> default</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">...</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">tseslint.configs.recommendedTypeChecked, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">...</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">oxlint.configs[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'flat/recommended'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]];</span></span></code></pre></div><p>更新 lint-staged 配置，先运行 oxlint 再运行 ESLint：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;lint-staged&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;*.{ts,tsx}&quot;: [&quot;oxlint --fix&quot;, &quot;eslint --fix&quot;]&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"lint-staged\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"*.{ts,tsx}\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"oxlint --fix\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"eslint --fix\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>更新 CI 脚本：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"lint:&#10;  script:&#10;    - npx oxlint --deny-warnings .&#10;    - npx eslint .\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">lint</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  script</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">npx oxlint --deny-warnings .</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">npx eslint .</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>阶段</th>\n<th>oxlint 负责</th>\n<th>ESLint 负责</th>\n<th>预期效果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>第一阶段</td>\n<td>基础语法规则</td>\n<td>全部高级规则</td>\n<td>CI 提速 30-50%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>第二阶段</td>\n<td>+ React/Hooks 规则</td>\n<td>类型感知 + 自定义</td>\n<td>CI 提速 50-70%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>第三阶段</td>\n<td>+ Import 规则</td>\n<td>仅类型感知 + 自定义</td>\n<td>CI 提速 70-80%</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"回归验证与质量保证\">回归验证与质量保证</h2><p>迁移过程中必须确保代码质量不降级。这需要一套系统化的验证流程。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"eslint . 2&gt;&amp;1 | wc -l&#10;biome check . 2&gt;&amp;1 | wc -l&#10;&#10;prettier --check &quot;src/**/*.{ts,tsx}&quot; 2&gt;&amp;1 | tail -1&#10;biome format --check &quot;src/**/*.{ts,tsx}&quot; 2&gt;&amp;1 | tail -1\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">eslint</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> .</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> 2>&#x26;1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> wc</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -l</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">biome</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> check</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> .</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> 2>&#x26;1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> wc</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -l</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">prettier</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --check</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"src/**/*.{ts,tsx}\"</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> 2>&#x26;1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> tail</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">biome</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> format</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --check</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"src/**/*.{ts,tsx}\"</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> 2>&#x26;1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> tail</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -1</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface RegressionChecklist {&#10;  rulesCoverage: &#39;所有 error 级别的 ESLint 规则在新工具中都有对应&#39;;&#10;  formatConsistency: &#39;biome format 输出与 prettier 输出的 diff 在可接受范围内&#39;;&#10;  ciParity: &#39;新工具在 CI 中的检查结果不弱于旧工具&#39;;&#10;  editorExperience: &#39;编辑器中的实时检查和保存时格式化正常工作&#39;;&#10;  performanceGain: &#39;lint 和格式化总耗时有明确的提升&#39;;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> RegressionChecklist</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  rulesCoverage</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '所有 error 级别的 ESLint 规则在新工具中都有对应'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  formatConsistency</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'biome format 输出与 prettier 输出的 diff 在可接受范围内'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  ciParity</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '新工具在 CI 中的检查结果不弱于旧工具'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  editorExperience</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '编辑器中的实时检查和保存时格式化正常工作'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  performanceGain</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'lint 和格式化总耗时有明确的提升'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>对比工具的输出差异：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"prettier --write &quot;src/**/*.ts&quot;&#10;git diff --stat&#10;&#10;git checkout .&#10;&#10;biome format --write &quot;src/**/*.ts&quot;&#10;git diff --stat\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">prettier</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --write</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"src/**/*.ts\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> diff</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --stat</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> checkout</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> .</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">biome</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> format</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --write</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"src/**/*.ts\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> diff</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --stat</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>验证项</th>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>通过标准</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>规则覆盖</td>\n<td>对比 error 级规则清单</td>\n<td>100% 覆盖</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>格式化一致性</td>\n<td>diff 输出对比</td>\n<td>差异 &lt;3% 文件</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CI 时间</td>\n<td>前后 CI 日志对比</td>\n<td>有明确提升</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>编辑器体验</td>\n<td>手动验证 formatOnSave</td>\n<td>正常工作</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>团队接受度</td>\n<td>试运行 1 周收集反馈</td>\n<td>无阻塞性问题</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((迁移指南))&#10;    评估阶段&#10;      规则覆盖审计&#10;      自定义规则识别&#10;      CI 集成检查&#10;    策略选择&#10;      全量 Biome&#10;      渐进 oxlint&#10;      混合方案&#10;    Biome 迁移&#10;      migrate 命令&#10;      配置调整&#10;      依赖清理&#10;    oxlint 迁移&#10;      eslint-plugin-oxlint&#10;      分阶段扩展&#10;      双工具并行&#10;    验证保证&#10;      规则覆盖对比&#10;      格式化一致性&#10;      CI 性能验证\">mindmap\n  root((迁移指南))\n    评估阶段\n      规则覆盖审计\n      自定义规则识别\n      CI 集成检查\n    策略选择\n      全量 Biome\n      渐进 oxlint\n      混合方案\n    Biome 迁移\n      migrate 命令\n      配置调整\n      依赖清理\n    oxlint 迁移\n      eslint-plugin-oxlint\n      分阶段扩展\n      双工具并行\n    验证保证\n      规则覆盖对比\n      格式化一致性\n      CI 性能验证</pre><ul>\n<li>迁移前必须审计现有 ESLint 规则的覆盖缺口，特别关注类型感知规则和自定义规则</li>\n<li>Biome 提供了自动化的 <code>migrate</code> 命令，适合规则简单的项目快速迁移</li>\n<li>大型项目推荐渐进引入 oxlint + <code>eslint-plugin-oxlint</code>，分阶段扩大覆盖</li>\n<li>回归验证需覆盖规则覆盖率、格式化一致性、CI 性能和编辑器体验四个维度</li>\n<li>迁移的终极目标是性能提升和工具链简化，而非完全替代 ESLint 的所有能力</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"迁移指南：从 ESLint/Prettier 到新一代工具","id":"迁移指南-从-eslint-prettier-到新一代工具"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"迁移前评估","id":"迁移前评估"},{"level":2,"text":"迁移到 Biome","id":"迁移到-biome"},{"level":2,"text":"渐进引入 oxlint","id":"渐进引入-oxlint"},{"level":2,"text":"回归验证与质量保证","id":"回归验证与质量保证"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"新一代工具横向对比","url":"/l-doc-books/h/editors-compilers/code-formatting-linting/next-gen-tools/tool-comparison"},"next":{"title":"lint-staged 与 Husky 实战","url":"/l-doc-books/h/editors-compilers/code-formatting-linting/team-ci-integration/lint-staged-husky"}}